Chapter: Barrier

 Memory barrier type definitions for GPU kernels. MBarrier is a
 hardware-accelerated barrier (Hopper+) with state tracking:
 Uninit, Ready, Invalidated.

 We say:

Section: Types

  MBarrierState =
    | MBUninit
    | MBReady
    | MBInvalidated

  MBarrier = record {
    mb-id : Integer,
    mb-expected : Integer,
    mb-state : MBarrierState
  }

